# Safe Linting Execution
RULE: Always use timeout for linters. Never run ruff/basedpyright on workspace root or without source dir.
WHY: Linters can hang; 30+ repo workspace causes resource exhaustion and zombie processes.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/quality-gates-service-template.sh, .cursor/rules/basedpyright-safety.mdc
DO: `timeout 30 ruff check <source_dir>/`; `timeout 120 basedpyright <source_dir>/`; `run_timeout 120 basedpyright <source_dir>/` # use run_timeout helper — see codex QG template SSOT; job-level timeout in CI
NEVER: `ruff check .`; `basedpyright .`; run linters without timeout
